{"id":"W62d5e0646b11c44028170bc6","zh":"峰峰值","en":"","name":"峰峰值","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W62d5e0646b11c44028170bc6","text":"峰峰值","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S1e22fe4987ac67dadb9a","source_id":"P103","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"从上述可知,主成分1主要对车体振动的整体状态进行控制,如均方根值、绝对均值、方根幅值等指标主要表征轨道不平顺幅值的整体波动状态;主成分2 主要控制车体的振动峰值大小,如峰峰值、峰值指标、 裕度指标、峭度指标等均反映了轨道不平顺波峰的尖锐程度 [13]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P103","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S123927bbbee39f39a67f","source_id":"P103","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"从图5可知,以权系数±0.3为界,1、3、4号特征参数,即表1中的绝对均值、方根均值、方根幅值,对车体垂向和横向振动的主成分1起主要的信息表达作用;在主成分2中,16、17号特征参数,即子频带能量 1、子频带能量2,其所在频率范围分别为1~2m -1、 0.5~1m -1,对车体水平、垂向振动均有较大的权系数;2、6、19号特征参数,即最大值、峰峰值、子频带能量4,所在频率范围为0.125~0.25m -1,对车体垂向振动加速度的整体波动也起极为重要的作用。","citations":[{"source_id":"P103","page":6,"page_end":6}]}],"sources":{"P103":{"id":"P103","title":"轨道不平顺作用下铁路列车车体振动状态的PCA-SVM预测分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2014","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8361.2014.07.003","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-pca-svm-forecast-of-car-body-vibration-states-of-railway-locomotives-and-vehicles-under-the-action-o"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"信号最大值与最小值之差，参与振动峰值相关信息的表达。","language":"zh","source_id":"P103","paper_slug":"2014-pca-svm-forecast-of-car-body-vibration-states-of-railway-locomotives-and-vehicles-under-the-action-o","title":"轨道不平顺作用下铁路列车车体振动状态的PCA-SVM预测分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W2dbdbb89357524f23f39a9b1","name":"Peak-to-peak value","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W2dbdbb89357524f23f39a9b1","name